        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "主人公の指揮の下、なんとか密猟者たちを\n追い込むことに成功したのだが――。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "1d651ba1e50fd5576df839c219e6518a7dad16451cb6647368869c4731d963dc",
